Tools/chimera is a development tool that links Chimera, an articulatory speech synthesiser
(https://github.com/jamesondh/chimera-vocal-synth), pinned to a fixed revision. Files it
generates, such as articulator tables and trajectories, derive from Chimera's data and
remain available under its MIT License below. Chimera is not part of the app bundle.

