The app bundles uv 0.13.6 (Contents/Helpers/uv) from Astral Software Inc.
(https://github.com/astral-sh/uv), unmodified, under the MIT License (Copyright (c) 2025 Astral
Software Inc.; uv is also available under the Apache License 2.0). The MIT permission notice is
the same as the one above. It runs the app's local Python runtime.

The app bundles whisper-server (Contents/Helpers/whisper-server), built unmodified from whisper.cpp
1.9.5 (https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp), which includes ggml. It runs local transcription.
The optional speech recognition model it downloads is whisper.cpp's GGML conversion of OpenAI's
Whisper base model (https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp, revision
5359861c739e955e79d9a303bcbc70fb988958b1); the Whisper weights are released by OpenAI under the
MIT License (Copyright (c) 2022 OpenAI). whisper.cpp is licensed as follows:

